# X12 v2: pure-Python Authenticode verifier for Linux/macOS (Windows uses
# WinVerifyTrust). signify: MIT licence. Its dependencies (asn1crypto,
# oscrypto / cryptography, depending on the version) are MIT / BSD / Apache-2.0
# - confirm against the resolved lock before release.
#
# The exact pins WITH HASHES must be generated on a machine with network
# access and reviewed (not done on the build laptop, which is offline):
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes requirements-signature.in -o requirements-signature.lock
#   pip install --require-hashes -r requirements-signature.lock
# Until then the verifier reports 'unavailable' (no cap) wherever signify
# is missing.
signify
